// THESIS: a batch proceeds through four explicit stages. OWN-WORLD: white production board and cobalt stage state. STORY: inspect prompts, recipe, execution and outputs in one direction. FIRST VIEWPORT: left-to-right four-stage board with dispatch footer. FORM: batch flow, no old sidebar/card structure. Static visual exploration only.
function renderFlow(){return `<main class="shell flow">${brandHeader('任务编排')}<header class="flow-intro"><div><div class="breadcrumb">工作空间 / 生成批次</div><h1>静物习作，第一组。</h1><p class="hint">让输入、配方和结果都有明确的位置。</p></div><div class="row"><span class="pill">批次草稿 · 演示</span><span class="mock-action">提示词历史</span><span class="mock-action">导出作品</span></div></header><div class="stages"><section class="stage-column"><div class="stage-heading"><span class="stage-number">1</span><div><h2>写下画面</h2><p>多行提示词 / 批次输入</p></div></div><div class="prompt-list"><div class="prompt-entry"><span>提示词 01</span><p>晨光里的橘猫，蓝色陶瓷花瓶，浅景深，写实摄影。</p><small>3 次抽奖</small></div><div class="prompt-entry"><span>提示词 02</span><p>窗边的白色花朵，柔和侧光，安静的室内静物。</p><small>3 次抽奖</small></div><div class="prompt-entry"><span>提示词 03</span><p>木质书桌与书本，午后阳光穿过窗帘。</p><small>3 次抽奖</small></div></div><div class="rule"><div class="section-label">统一前后缀</div><div class="field-box">前缀：高质量摄影</div><div class="field-box" style="margin-top:8px">后缀：自然光</div><p class="hint" style="margin-top:12px">输入区也可直接粘贴多行文本。</p></div></section><section class="stage-column"><div class="stage-heading"><span class="stage-number">2</span><div><h2>选择配方</h2><p>模型专属参数建议</p></div></div><div class="flow-recipe"><small>生图模型　⌄</small><h3>FLUX.2 klein 4B</h3><p class="hint">FP8 · 4 步蒸馏版</p></div>${recipeGrid('1024 × 1024 · 1:1','4','1','3')}<div class="rule"><div class="row spread"><h3>种子</h3><span class="pill">−1 · 随机</span></div><p class="hint" style="margin-top:12px">每张图片独立抽奖。<br>固定种子则逐张递增。</p></div><p class="hint" style="margin-top:20px">恢复推荐值<br>切换模型也会更新等待任务，不影响正在生成的图片。</p><div class="rule"><small>其他可选模型</small><p class="hint">Z-Image-Turbo<br>Qwen-Image 2.1 · INT8<br>SDXL Turbo</p></div></section><section class="stage-column queue-inline"><div class="stage-heading active"><span class="stage-number">3</span><div><h2>进入队列</h2><p>执行顺序 / 当前任务</p></div></div><div class="row spread"><span class="pill">生成中 · 示意</span><small>3 / 9 完成</small></div><div class="cell"><span class="state-label">当前任务</span><p>晨光里的橘猫 · 第 2 张</p><small>Qwen-Image 2.1</small><small>正在运行，切换模型后仍会完成。</small></div><div class="cell"><span class="state-label">等待中</span><p>窗边的白色花朵 · 第 1 张</p><small>FLUX.2 klein 4B</small></div><div class="cell"><span class="state-label">等待中</span><p>窗边的白色花朵 · 第 2 张</p><small>FLUX.2 klein 4B</small></div><div class="cell"><span class="state-label">等待中</span><p>木质书桌与书本 · 第 1 张</p><small>FLUX.2 klein 4B</small></div><div class="rule"><div class="row plain-static"><span>暂停 / 恢复</span><span>打乱</span><span>停止当前</span><span>清空</span></div><p class="hint" style="margin-top:12px">单项任务：置顶 / 跳过 / 删除<br>清空队列仍保留已生成作品。</p></div></section><section class="stage-column flow-output"><div class="stage-heading"><span class="stage-number">4</span><div><h2>挑选结果</h2><p>按提示词归组 / 多次抽奖</p></div></div><figure><img src="../assets/flux2.png" alt="FLUX.2 已有模型测试输出"><figcaption><strong>晨光里的橘猫</strong><br><small>FLUX.2 klein 4B · 1024 × 1024</small></figcaption></figure><figure><img src="../assets/qwen.png" alt="Qwen 已有模型测试输出"><figcaption><strong>同一主题，另一种模型</strong><br><small>Qwen-Image 2.1 · 768 × 768</small></figcaption></figure><div class="static-tabs"><span class="current">全部</span><span>收藏</span><span>隐藏点踩</span></div><p class="hint" style="margin-top:12px">图像详情：模型、种子、比例、步数、耗时。可下载与复用提示词。</p></section></div><div class="run-footer"><div><strong>3 条提示词 × 3 次抽奖 = 9 个任务</strong><p class="hint">采用当前配方，保存为独立任务。</p></div><span class="mock-action primary">${uiIcon('arrow')} 加入生成队列</span></div><div class="flow-bottom"><span>本地 ComfyUI</span><span>RTX 5070 Ti · 16GB</span><span>系统日志</span><span>本地目录</span><span>服务设置</span></div></main>`;}
